L["/dui welcome - what's new in Daylight UI 2.0, and the new portraits and tooltips to pick from"] = "/dui welcome - las novedades de Daylight UI 2.0 y los nuevos retratos y tooltips para elegir"
L["1 min"] = "1 min"
L["1 of them is yours and isn't counted."] = "1 de ellos es tuyo y no se cuenta."
L["2 hours"] = "2 horas"
